  "name": "minataur2",
  "description": "A high-performance blockchain explorer and archive management platform engineered for the Mina Protocol, emphasizing real-time state visualization and historical data integrity. It leverages a PostgreSQL backend with specialized triggers and views to index recursive zero-knowledge state transitions, ZK-app interactions, and canonical chain transitions. The system delivers low-latency network insights through a unified GraphQL API and WebSocket-driven frontend, supporting validator performance auditing and peer-to-peer topology mapping.",
